# Deadly Complication's second mode needs a suspected creature YOU control. Turn 2: Bot2's Memnite enters. Turn 3: J. Jonah Jameson suspects Bot2's Memnite: it is suspected but not Bot1's, and Bot1's own
# Jameson is not suspected, so neither is a legal target of the second mode on turn 5. The first mode alone destroys the suspected Memnite.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
J. Jonah Jameson
Deadly Complication
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

